.git/
.github/
README.md

# Local development artifacts inside the submodules. CI checks out fresh and
# never has these, so excluding them keeps a local build honest (and much
# smaller) instead of copying a host-built venv into a Linux image.
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.cache/
apps/*/data/
